imes B\\times A$ consists of every combination of ${v,w}$ with ${3,4,5}$ and ${v,w},$ which results in\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\times B\\times A={ & (v,3,v),(v,3,w),(v,4,v),(v,4,w),(v,5,v),(v,5,w), \\\\  & (w,3,v),(w,3,w),(w,4,v),(w,4,w),(w,5,v),(w,5,w)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that\n\n$$\n|A\\times B\\times A|=|A|\\cdot |B|\\cdot |A|=2\\cdot 3\\cdot 2=12.\n$$\n\nFrom the given options, we see that both $(v,3,w)$ and $(w,5,w)$ are in $A\\times B\\times A.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307273 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307274 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307275 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307276 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307277 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1041 "selection" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307273 13194139534746 true] [17592186307272 1110 #uuid "4553e1d7-7769-5cec-b0e6-9d803661cb8e" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307273 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307273 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534746 true] [17592186307273 1111 #uuid "9d7276a3-e82b-5fa2-8bb6-77cb6fe55635" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307274 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307274 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534746 true] [17592186307274 1111 #uuid "a587152f-e493-59d4-83dd-aebfaa43bb21" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307275 1034 "III only" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307275 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534746 true] [17592186307275 1111 #uuid "0071e69c-f87c-5de7-9e45-a6d0f7009742" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307276 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534746 true] [17592186307276 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534746 true] [17592186307276 1111 #uuid "98e97654-5597-5a99-935f-082ca2a531da" 13194139534746 true] [1759218630